#: ../../content/applications/general/email_communication/email_servers_outbound.rst:162
msgid "The Alias Domain Bounce Alias (default value = `bounce`),"
msgstr "Az Áliasdomain visszaküldési álneve (alapértelmezett érték = `bounce`),"

